+  - belongsTo: `author` → PostAuthorSummary
+  - belongsToMany: `tags` → Tag
+- **PostTag** (app/Models/PostTag.ts) — table: `postTags`
+- **Tag** (app/Models/Tag.ts) — table: `tags`
+- **User** (app/Models/User.ts) — table: `users`
+  - hasMany: `posts` → Post
